    <string name="faq_changelog_title">Version history (personal fork)</string>
    <string name="faq_changelog_text">This Fossify Clock is a personal fork, based on the original open source Fossify project (github.com/FossifyOrg/Clock).\n\nv1.0.3 (current): new alarm/timer starts with a blank name field (no longer inherits the last used label), creating or editing a timer starts it right away and moves it to the top of the list (sorted by last used, not creation date), clearer drag button on the ringing screen (circular background with border and double-chevron arrows pointing both directions).\n\nv1.0.2: About screen states this is a personal fork with a link to the repository and version history.\n\nv1.0.1: fixes - \'Confirm\' button instead of \'OK\', keyboard no longer covers buttons when editing an alarm, alarms sorted by time by default, fixed sound on alarms and timers, group name shown as prefix in the \'All\' view, new alarm created from within a group inherits that group.\n\nv1.0.0: first version with alarm groups - create/rename/delete groups (with option on what to do with their alarms when deleting a group), enable/disable an entire group, filter alarms by group, group selector when editing an alarm.\n\nFull source code: github.com/alucasr/Clock</string>
